sux-ui_preface.sh|193|175|Scope and Non-Goals|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|The UI framework is designed for structured command-line applications. It is not|sux-ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Scope and Non-Goals:
sux-ui_preface.sh|194|176|Scope and Non-Goals|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|intended to be a full-screen TUI toolkit, a graphical interface, or a replacement|sux-ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Scope and Non-Goals:
sux-ui_preface.sh|195|177|Scope and Non-Goals|User Interface||normal|||L2Sectionbody|for dedicated terminal-layout libraries.|sux-ui_preface.sh::User Interface:Scope and Non-Goals:
