sux-deployment_preface.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - Deployment Boundary|sux-deployment_preface.sh::::
sux-deployment_preface.sh|20|2|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionheader|Deployment|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|21|3|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|22|4|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|Deployment sits on the boundary between the installed SolidGroundUX Framework and|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|23|5|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|the SDK that creates and moves release artifacts. The Framework owns the runtime|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|24|6|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|entry point that can install, update, roll back, repair, or remove products. The SDK|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|25|7|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|owns release preparation, development deployment, and the tooling used to produce|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|26|8|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|those product packages.|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|27|9|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|28|10|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|Keeping that boundary explicit avoids two different deployment stories appearing in|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|29|11|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|the documentation. This Framework section therefore describes only the installed|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|30|12|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|lifecycle boundary. The detailed release-development workflow belongs to the|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|31|13|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|SolidGroundUX SDK documentation.|sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|32|14|Deployment|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||sux-deployment_preface.sh:::Deployment:
