sux-deployment_preface.sh|35|17|Setup|Deployment||normal|||L2Sectionbody|`sgnd-setup.sh` is the canonical setup and lifecycle entry point for current|sux-deployment_preface.sh::Deployment:Setup:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|36|18|Setup|Deployment||normal|||L2Sectionbody|SolidGroundUX installations. It is deliberately self-sufficient: it can bootstrap a|sux-deployment_preface.sh::Deployment:Setup:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|37|19|Setup|Deployment||normal|||L2Sectionbody|clean machine before the Framework exists and can continue to operate when an|sux-deployment_preface.sh::Deployment:Setup:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|38|20|Setup|Deployment||normal|||L2Sectionbody|installed Framework is incomplete or damaged.|sux-deployment_preface.sh::Deployment:Setup:
