sux-deployment_preface.sh|41|23|Setup|Deployment||normal|||L2Sectionbody|contains the complete release payload, manifest, removal manifest, and integrity|sux-deployment_preface.sh::Deployment:Setup:
sux-deployment_preface.sh|42|24|Setup|Deployment||normal|||L2Sectionbody|sidecars required to install or reconcile that product.|sux-deployment_preface.sh::Deployment:Setup:
