untar-it.sh|15|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Selects a .tar.gz archive, validates its entry paths, extracts it into a temporary|untar-it.sh::::
untar-it.sh|16|4||||normal|||modulebody|  staging directory, and restores files matching an optional directory and filename|untar-it.sh::::
untar-it.sh|17|5||||normal|||modulebody|  mask beneath a selected target root.|untar-it.sh::::
