sgnd-smoketest.sh|15|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|sgnd-smoketest.sh::::
sgnd-smoketest.sh|16|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Framework-owned smoke-test and validation implementation for SolidGroundUX. Supports individual validation suites, a complete Run All|sgnd-smoketest.sh::::
sgnd-smoketest.sh|17|4||||normal|||modulebody|  pass, and the original interactive UI smoke-test menu.|sgnd-smoketest.sh::::
sgnd-smoketest.sh|18|5||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-smoketest.sh::::
sgnd-smoketest.sh|19|6||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|sgnd-smoketest.sh::::
sgnd-smoketest.sh|20|7||||normal|||modulebody|  - Validation suites are non-destructive.|sgnd-smoketest.sh::::
sgnd-smoketest.sh|21|8||||normal|||modulebody|  - Console registration is tested after explicitly loading all discovered modules,|sgnd-smoketest.sh::::
sgnd-smoketest.sh|22|9||||normal|||modulebody|    avoiding false failures caused by the Management Console's lazy-loading model.|sgnd-smoketest.sh::::
sgnd-smoketest.sh|23|10||||normal|||modulebody|  - Existing module validators remain owned by their respective modules and are|sgnd-smoketest.sh::::
sgnd-smoketest.sh|24|11||||normal|||modulebody|    invoked rather than duplicated here.|sgnd-smoketest.sh::::
sgnd-smoketest.sh|25|12||||normal|||modulebody|  - Test sections use one consistent finish and summary pattern.|sgnd-smoketest.sh::::
