sgnd-bootstrap.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - Bootstrap Core|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides the central bootstrap mechanism for all SolidGroundUX scripts.|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|16|5||||label|||modulebody|The library|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|17|6||||normal|||modulebody|    - Orchestrates framework initialization sequence|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Loads core and declared libraries (SGND_USING)|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Parses and separates framework and script arguments|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Initializes environment, configuration, and runtime state|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Applies standard execution flow for all scripts|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody|    - Ensures consistent startup behavior across all tools|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|23|12||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
sgnd-bootstrap.sh|24|13||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|sgnd-bootstrap.sh::::
