sgnd-datatable.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides a lightweight, schema-driven datatable abstraction for handling|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody|  structured data within shell scripts.|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|16|5||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|17|6||||label|||modulebody|The library|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Defines schema-based row structures using delimited fields|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Stores and manages tabular data in indexed arrays|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports row insertion, retrieval, and iteration|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Enables field-based access using schema definitions|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody|    - Provides helper functions for filtering and transformation|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|23|12||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|24|13||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Minimal abstraction on top of native shell arrays|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|26|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Schema-driven access for readability and consistency|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|27|16||||normal|||modulebody|  - Predictable and explicit data handling|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|28|17||||normal|||modulebody|  - Lightweight implementation without external dependencies|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|29|18||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|30|19||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|31|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Core data structure used across SolidGroundUX tooling|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|32|21||||normal|||modulebody|  - Backbone for metadata parsing, UI rendering, and data exchange|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|33|22||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|34|23||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|35|24||||normal|||modulebody|  - Full relational data modeling or query capabilities|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|36|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Persistent storage or database functionality|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|37|26||||normal|||modulebody|  - Replacement for external data processing tools|sgnd-datatable.sh::::
sgnd-datatable.sh|38|27||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-datatable.sh::::
