ui-dlg.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - UI Dialogs|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Implements dialog-oriented interaction patterns for console applications.|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody||ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|16|5||||label|||modulebody|The library|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|17|6||||normal|||modulebody|    - Provides higher-level dialog constructs built on top of ui-ask|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports timed prompts with auto-continue behavior|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Normalizes user responses into consistent action tokens|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Enables structured interaction flows such as confirmations and selections|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Integrates with UI rendering for consistent look and feel|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody||ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|23|12||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|24|13||||normal|||modulebody|  - Build on top of primitive input helpers (ui-ask)|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Normalize interaction results for predictable scripting|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|26|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Keep dialogs lightweight and composable|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|27|16||||normal|||modulebody|  - Support both interactive and semi-automated scenarios|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|28|17||||normal|||modulebody||ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|29|18||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|30|19||||normal|||modulebody|  - Intermediate interaction layer between raw input (ui-ask) and applications|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|31|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Used by scripts requiring structured or timed user decisions|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|32|21||||normal|||modulebody||ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|33|22||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|34|23||||normal|||modulebody|  - Full-screen or TUI-style dialog systems|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|35|24||||normal|||modulebody|  - Complex workflow/state engines|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|36|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Persistent dialog sessions|ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|37|26||||normal|||modulebody||ui-dlg.sh::::
ui-dlg.sh|46|27|Library guard|||normal|||L1Sectionheader|Library guard|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:
ui-dlg.sh|47|28|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionheader|_sgnd_lib_guard - Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|48|29|Library guard|||highlight|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|Purpose|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|49|30|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|  Ensure the file is sourced as a library and initialized only once.|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|50|31|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody||ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|51|32|Library guard|||highlight|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|Behavior|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|52|33|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|  - Derives a unique guard variable name from the current filename.|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|53|34|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|  - Aborts execution when the file is run directly instead of sourced.|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|54|35|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|  - Sets the guard variable on first load.|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|55|36|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|  - Returns immediately when the library was already loaded.|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|56|37|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody||ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|57|38|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|Inputs|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|58|39|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|  BASH_SOURCE[0]|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
ui-dlg.sh|59|40|Library guard|||normal|_sgnd_lib_guard|Enforce source-only, single-load library initialization|functionbody|  $0|ui-dlg.sh:::Library guard:_sgnd_lib_guard
