sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - Header Parser|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides parsing, lookup, and update utilities for canonical script header comments|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody|  used throughout the SolidGroundUX framework.|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|16|5||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|17|6||||label|||modulebody|The library|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Detects top-level canonical header sections|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Loads header section fields into sgnd-datatable structures|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Extracts banner information such as product and title|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Reads individual header field values from structured sections|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody|    - Updates existing header fields while preserving formatting|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|23|12||||normal|||modulebody|    - Adds missing fields where required|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|24|13||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports checksum, build, and semantic version metadata workflows|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|26|15||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|27|16||||normal|||modulebody|  - Header comments are treated as structured, machine-readable data|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|28|17||||normal|||modulebody|  - Header parsing and header mutation are kept predictable and convention-based|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|29|18||||normal|||modulebody|  - Existing field formatting is preserved wherever possible|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|30|19||||normal|||modulebody|  - Metadata workflows remain independent from higher-level UI logic|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|31|20||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|32|21||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|33|22||||normal|||modulebody|  - Core header metadata parsing and update layer for script tooling|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|34|23||||normal|||modulebody|  - Supports release preparation and other header-aware development utilities|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|35|24||||normal|||modulebody|  - Provides the canonical API for header field inspection and mutation|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|36|25||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|37|26||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|38|27||||normal|||modulebody|  - Parsing arbitrary inline documentation blocks in source bodies|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|39|28||||normal|||modulebody|  - Rendering documentation output|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|40|29||||normal|||modulebody|  - Acting as a general-purpose text processing library|sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh|41|30||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-comment-header-parser.sh::::
