ui-ask.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports timed auto-continue prompts with simple intervention keys|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports typed and immediate choice selection helpers|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports normalized absolute and relative datetime input through ask_datetime|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|23|12||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports prompting a variable set from field-spec lines|ui-ask.sh::::
ui-ask.sh|24|13||||normal|||modulebody|    - Reads input from the controlling terminal to avoid stdin conflicts|ui-ask.sh::::
