sgnd-menu.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX - Menu Library|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|13|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|14|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides the reusable menu system used by the management console and other SolidGroundUX applications.|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|15|4||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|16|5||||label|||modulebody|The library|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|17|6||||normal|||modulebody|    - Defines menu structures and item registration mechanisms|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|18|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - Supports grouping, ordering, and labeling of menu items|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|19|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - Integrates with rendering helpers to display menus consistently|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|20|9||||normal|||modulebody|    - Handles user selection and dispatch to registered actions|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|21|10||||normal|||modulebody|    - Enables modular extension by allowing external modules to register items|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|22|11||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|23|12||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|24|13||||normal|||modulebody|  - Modular menu composition through registration rather than hardcoding|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|25|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - Clear separation between menu definition, rendering, and execution|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|26|15||||normal|||modulebody|  - Predictable navigation and selection behavior|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|27|16||||normal|||modulebody|  - Minimal coupling to specific applications or modules|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|28|17||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|29|18||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|30|19||||normal|||modulebody|  - Reusable SolidGroundUX UI component|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|31|20||||normal|||modulebody|  - Bridges UI rendering, input handling, and executable scripts|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|32|21||||normal|||modulebody|  - Enables pluggable console applications through module-based menus|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|33|22||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|34|23||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|35|24||||normal|||modulebody|  - Full TUI frameworks or complex screen management|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|36|25||||normal|||modulebody|  - Persistent menu state beyond runtime session|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|37|26||||normal|||modulebody|  - Business logic execution beyond dispatching actions|sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|38|27||||normal|||modulebody||sgnd-menu.sh::::
sgnd-menu.sh|47|28|Library guard|||normal|||L1Sectionheader|Library guard|sgnd-menu.sh:::Library guard:
