sgnd-setup.sh|113|36|Standalone UI|||normal|||L3Sectionbody|Bootstrap palette: design-time snapshot of the SolidGroundUX default theme.|sgnd-setup.sh:::Standalone UI:
sgnd-setup.sh|114|37|Standalone UI|||normal|||L3Sectionbody|It deliberately mirrors the normal default palette/style closely, but has no|sgnd-setup.sh:::Standalone UI:
sgnd-setup.sh|115|38|Standalone UI|||normal|||L3Sectionbody|runtime dependency on SolidGroundUX.|sgnd-setup.sh:::Standalone UI:
