manage-framework-state.sh|20|7||||normal|||modulebody|  - Libraries never auto-execute (composition over inheritance)|manage-framework-state.sh::::
manage-framework-state.sh|21|8||||normal|||modulebody|  - Framework integration is opt-in and declarative|manage-framework-state.sh::::
