exe-template.sh|2|1||||normal|||moduleheader|SolidGroundUX SDK - Executable Script Template|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|14|2||||label|||modulebody|Description|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|15|3||||normal|||modulebody|  Provides the standard structure for all executable scripts in the framework,|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|16|4||||label|||modulebody|including|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|17|5||||normal|||modulebody|    - bootstrap resolution and framework initialization|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|18|6||||normal|||modulebody|    - optional argument parsing and configuration integration|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|19|7||||normal|||modulebody|    - metadata declaration and lifecycle hooks|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|20|8||||normal|||modulebody|    - a consistent main() entry pattern|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|21|9||||normal|||modulebody||exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|22|10||||label|||modulebody|Design principles|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|23|11||||normal|||modulebody|  - Executables are explicit: resolve, bootstrap, then run|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|24|12||||normal|||modulebody|  - Libraries never auto-execute (composition over inheritance)|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|25|13||||normal|||modulebody|  - Framework integration is opt-in and declarative|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|26|14||||normal|||modulebody|  - UI and input must be TTY-safe|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|27|15||||normal|||modulebody||exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|28|16||||label|||modulebody|Role in framework|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|29|17||||normal|||modulebody|  - Entry point pattern for all SolidGroundUX-based scripts|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|30|18||||normal|||modulebody|  - Defines how scripts integrate with sgnd-bootstrap and common libraries|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|31|19||||normal|||modulebody||exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|32|20||||label|||modulebody|Non-goals|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|33|21||||normal|||modulebody|  - Business logic implementation (provided by the script author)|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|34|22||||normal|||modulebody|  - Library behavior (handled in /common modules)|exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|35|23||||normal|||modulebody||exe-template.sh::::
exe-template.sh|44|24|Bootstrap|||normal|||L1Sectionheader|Bootstrap|exe-template.sh:::Bootstrap:
