sdk_preface.sh|22|4|SolidGroundUX SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|The SolidGroundUX SDK is the development and release-engineering companion to the|sdk_preface.sh:::SolidGroundUX SDK:
sdk_preface.sh|23|5|SolidGroundUX SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|SolidGroundUX Framework. It contains the tools and templates used to create|sdk_preface.sh:::SolidGroundUX SDK:
sdk_preface.sh|24|6|SolidGroundUX SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|repository-shaped workspaces, maintain metadata, generate documentation, deploy|sdk_preface.sh:::SolidGroundUX SDK:
sdk_preface.sh|25|7|SolidGroundUX SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|development trees, and prepare distributable product releases.|sdk_preface.sh:::SolidGroundUX SDK:
sdk_preface.sh|26|8|SolidGroundUX SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||sdk_preface.sh:::SolidGroundUX SDK:
sdk_preface.sh|27|9|SolidGroundUX SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|The SDK is not part of the Framework runtime. Applications and servers do not need|sdk_preface.sh:::SolidGroundUX SDK:
sdk_preface.sh|28|10|SolidGroundUX SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|the SDK merely to run SolidGroundUX. It exists for people building, documenting,|sdk_preface.sh:::SolidGroundUX SDK:
sdk_preface.sh|29|11|SolidGroundUX SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|testing, packaging, or releasing SolidGroundUX-based products.|sdk_preface.sh:::SolidGroundUX SDK:
