sdk-tools_preface.sh|23|4|SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|The SDK group contains the utilities used to create, maintain, deploy,|sdk-tools_preface.sh:::SDK:
sdk-tools_preface.sh|24|5|SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|document, package, and release SolidGroundUX-based projects.|sdk-tools_preface.sh:::SDK:
sdk-tools_preface.sh|25|6|SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody||sdk-tools_preface.sh:::SDK:
sdk-tools_preface.sh|26|7|SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|While the framework itself provides the runtime foundation for applications,|sdk-tools_preface.sh:::SDK:
sdk-tools_preface.sh|27|8|SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|the SDK tools support the development lifecycle around that runtime. Together|sdk-tools_preface.sh:::SDK:
sdk-tools_preface.sh|28|9|SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|they form a lightweight development environment for creating structured Bash|sdk-tools_preface.sh:::SDK:
sdk-tools_preface.sh|29|10|SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|applications without having to reinvent the surrounding project administration|sdk-tools_preface.sh:::SDK:
sdk-tools_preface.sh|30|11|SDK|||normal|||L1Sectionbody|for every new tool.|sdk-tools_preface.sh:::SDK:
