sdk-deployment_preface.sh|76|58|Setup|Deployment||normal|||L2Sectionbody|`sgnd-setup.sh` is the canonical installation and product-lifecycle interface for|sdk-deployment_preface.sh::Deployment:Setup:
sdk-deployment_preface.sh|77|59|Setup|Deployment||normal|||L2Sectionbody|current SolidGroundUX releases. It is self-sufficient enough to run before the|sdk-deployment_preface.sh::Deployment:Setup:
sdk-deployment_preface.sh|78|60|Setup|Deployment||normal|||L2Sectionbody|Framework exists and to remain usable for repair when the installed Framework cannot|sdk-deployment_preface.sh::Deployment:Setup:
